# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Build artifacts
*.log
# Committed benchmark evidence log (recovered at-scale run; see issue #556)
!benchmarks/transmon_bench_cpu/geode_runs_1p16M_2026-07-15.log
# Committed Palace run evidence log (tracked before *.log rule; negated for consistency)
!reference/fixtures/transmon_palace/results_p1/palace_run_v22.log
# #519 Palace-GPU head-to-head run evidence (raw per-run logs + provenance)
!benchmarks/transmon_bench_gpu/runs/**/*.log
# #520 GPU driven-scaling sweep run evidence (per-leg logs, Palace logs, TF32 evidence)
!benchmarks/gpu_driven_scaling/runs/**/*.log
# #927 like-for-like CPU re-timing raw mode logs (build.log stays ignored)
!benchmarks/transmon_bench_cpu/runs/**/raw/*.log
